The brow.

192
00:32:56,650 --> 00:32:57,431
and the jaw.

193
00:33:04,978 --> 00:33:05,679
Shoulders.

194
00:33:15,269 --> 00:33:21,595
Just acknowledging the posture, energised, up the spine, everything else, relax.

195
00:33:28,425 --> 00:33:30,909
This body is subject to disease.

196
00:33:35,713 --> 00:33:38,057
This body is of a nature to fall ill.

197
00:33:43,863 --> 00:33:46,586
This body has not gone beyond sickness.

198
00:33:54,335 --> 00:33:56,576
This body is subject to aging.

199
00:34:01,061 --> 00:34:03,724
This body has not gone beyond aging.

200
00:34:10,592 --> 00:34:21,905
This body is now in a process of aging.

201
00:34:21,925 --> 00:34:24,268
This body is subject to death

202
00:34:30,695 --> 00:34:33,077
This body has not gone beyond death.

203
00:34:33,137 --> 00:34:40,523
This body will die.

204
00:34:46,628 --> 00:34:53,074
There is the unborn, undying, uncreated, uncompounded.

205
00:34:59,438 --> 00:35:00,599
The unconditioned,

206
00:35:05,288 --> 00:35:08,373
True refuge, harbour and home.

207
00:35:15,065 --> 00:35:17,570
Perfect peace and contentment.

208
00:35:24,643 --> 00:35:28,090
Those who are mindful are in the presence of Nibbana.

209
00:35:34,380 --> 00:35:42,135
Settling on the breath and then opening up to whatever draws the attention within that field of awareness.

210
00:35:42,637 --> 00:35:47,766
Just watching, just feeling, just experiencing.

211
00:35:49,150 --> 00:35:49,871
Intimately.

212
00:35:51,614 --> 00:35:52,356
It's enough.

213
01:13:51,270 --> 01:14:19,658
Moments reflection Resolution

214
01:14:35,737 --> 01:14:40,703
So make sure you're sitting comfortably for our evening contemplations.

215
01:14:47,332 --> 01:14:50,136
Turn into our own hearts, speaking gently.

216
01:14:50,176 --> 01:14:58,909
May I be free of physical pain.

217
01:14:58,930 --> 01:15:02,014
May I be free of mental distress.

218
01:15:06,938 --> 01:15:09,860
May I be liberated of all my sufferings.

219
01:15:49,042 --> 01:15:51,885
Bringing to mind someone we know is having a hard time.

220
01:16:02,877 --> 01:16:05,320
May you be free of physical pain.

221
01:16:09,485 --> 01:16:12,349
May you be free of mental distress.

222
01:16:18,067 --> 01:16:20,971
May you be liberated of all your sufferings.

223
01:16:50,264 --> 01:17:01,377
And all those at this moment who are sick and or suffering from mental illness, people in the process of dying, and those who have died and left grieving family, relatives and friends.

224
01:17:02,779 --> 01:17:06,083
People going hungry, homeless and death destitute.

225
01:17:07,326 --> 01:17:11,832
Those having to deal with severe personal and interpersonal difficulties.

226
01:17:13,833 --> 01:17:16,778
All those who've been victims of prejudice,

227
01:17:17,787 --> 01:17:22,512
All those caught up in wars and repressive regimes and those being tortured.

228
01:17:24,494 --> 01:17:28,319
And there are those suffering from natural disasters and climate crisis.

229
01:17:30,121 --> 01:17:35,186
All the sentient beings are being cruelly treated and unnecessarily slaughtered.

230
01:17:36,328 --> 01:17:38,551
And all who find life meaningless.

231
01:17:40,474 --> 01:17:43,457
May you be free of physical pain.

232
01:17:48,500 --> 01:17:51,609
May you be free of mental distress.

233
01:17:57,007 --> 01:17:59,234
May you be liberated of all your suffering.

234
01:18:31,278 --> 01:18:58,095
radiating our care and compassion to all beings in all directions may all beings be free of physical pain may all beings be free of mental distress may all beings be liberated of all their sufferings

235
01:19:27,961 --> 01:19:33,327
Thinking to mind now some moments of joyfulness, happiness that we've experienced today.

236
01:19:43,358 --> 01:19:44,418
And rejoicing in that.

237
01:19:45,840 --> 01:19:47,421
May I be joyful.

238
01:19:50,185 --> 01:19:52,887
May I be ever more joyful.

239
01:19:57,677 --> 01:20:00,869
May I experience the bliss of liberation.

240
01:20:26,939 --> 01:20:32,027
Bringing to mind someone we know who has good cause to be joyful.

241
01:20:40,860 --> 01:20:42,404
And wish them greater joy.

242
01:20:43,506 --> 01:20:44,967
May you be joyful.

243
01:20:49,335 --> 01:20:51,798
May you be ever more joyful.

244
01:20:58,192 --> 01:21:01,435
May you experience the bliss of awakening.

245
01:21:31,012 --> 01:21:55,992
that all those at this moment who are happy and content with their lives who are enjoying the warmth of all levels of friendship enjoying the delights of art nature sport hobbies and so on who find their work meaningful who enjoy the fruitfulness of their spiritual practice and who rejoice in the success of others may you be joyful

246
01:21:59,801 --> 01:22:02,171
May you be ever more joyful.

247
01:22:07,752 --> 01:22:10,403
May you experience the bliss of Nirvana.

248
01:22:33,990 --> 01:22:56,217
radiating our joy to all beings in all directions may all beings be joyful may all beings be ever more joyful may all beings experience the bliss of libana

249
01:23:23,671 --> 01:23:25,653
Allowing these words to flow through us.

250
01:23:26,854 --> 01:23:31,559
If you are wise and want to reach the state of peace, then develop these qualities.

251
01:23:32,199 --> 01:23:35,384
Be upright, responsible, gentle and humble.

252
01:23:36,024 --> 01:23:39,908
Be easily content and need only a few things.

253
01:23:40,649 --> 01:23:42,971
Be less busy and live simply.

254
01:23:43,832 --> 01:23:46,274
Guard the senses and be modest.

255
01:23:47,235 --> 01:23:50,859
Do not be attached to only a few people, to the exclusion of others.

256
01:23:51,936 --> 01:23:55,362
Do not do the slightest thing that a wise person could blame you for.

257
01:23:56,302 --> 01:24:00,168
And be constantly thinking, may all beings be happy.

258
01:24:00,828 --> 01:24:13,847
Whatever living beings there are, be they weak or strong, big or small, large or slender, living nearby or far away, those who've already been born and those who've yet to be born.

259
01:24:13,868 --> 01:24:16,832
May all beings, without exception, be happy.

260
01:24:18,154 --> 01:24:21,217
Let no one deceive another or disdain any.

261
01:24:22,074 --> 01:24:25,337
Do not wish harm to anyone, not even when you're angry.

262
01:24:26,219 --> 01:24:33,587
Just as a mother would protect her only child at the risk of her own life, let the warmth of your heart go out to all beings.

263
01:24:34,347 --> 01:24:41,275
Let your love and goodwill spread throughout the whole world, above and below, without boundary, ill will or hatred.

264
01:24:42,436 --> 01:24:51,947
Whether you are standing, walking, sitting or lying down, so long as you are awake, you should develop this affectionate mindfulness.

265
01:24:52,432 --> 01:24:54,716
This, they say, is the noblest way to live.

266
01:24:55,516 --> 01:25:10,094
And if you do not fall into unskillful ways, but live well and develop insight and are no longer attached to all the desires of the senses, then truly you'll never need to be reborn into this world again.

267
01:25:12,256 --> 01:25:16,001
So feel free to join me in the chanting or offer these blessings.

268
01:25:16,100 --> 01:25:18,484
May you be safe, well and happy.

269
01:25:19,585 --> 01:25:21,967
May you live contented, in harmony,

270
01:25:22,132 --> 01:25:51,110
with the world.

271
01:25:51,715 --> 01:26:16,355
Santhendriyocchani bhagocchā bhagavokuleśu anānuhīdho na cākūdāṃ samācārekeñcīye nā viṇyu pāre upavādehu sukhi nā vākemi nā hāntu sābeśatā bhavāntu sukhi tātā

272
01:26:17,045 --> 01:26:40,099
yekechi panabhuta-thi tasa-vata-vada-va-ana-vasesam tiga-vayema-hantavam vimarasakalukatulam dita-vayema-aditaye ca-dureva-santi-avudhure

273
01:26:40,822 --> 01:27:07,284
bhūtā vāsaṁ bhāveśi vāsābeśātā bhāvantu sukhi tātā na paro bharaṁ nīkūpētā na tīmānyatā kathā cīnenkeṣu viyārosaṇṇāpati gāsañjā nānyamānyāsātukāṁ gīcēyā madhāyatā niyāṁ kūtā

274
01:27:07,518 --> 01:27:35,500
ayusai kaputanga nurake evampi saba bhutesu manasambhavaye aparimanam metenca sabalokasni manasambhavaye aparimanam udanga doca tiri anca asampatanga veranga sapatam

275
01:27:36,087 --> 01:28:02,988
Satsang with Mooji Satsang with Mooji Satsang with Mooji

276
01:28:04,470 --> 01:28:13,840
May all beings be happy.

277
01:28:14,342 --> 01:28:42,595
Very good.

278
01:28:43,333 --> 01:28:46,980
Don't forget, from now till we fall asleep is also part of our practice.

279
01:28:48,002 --> 01:28:51,529
Make it simple, take it easy, stay with the one who knows.

280
01:28:53,795 --> 01:28:59,787
Put something lovely in the heart, slip away into deep oblivion, only to wake to make the best of the day.

281
01:29:00,608 --> 01:29:03,012
May I wish you all a very peaceful night.

